The applicant/appellant shall not leave the State of Assam during the pendency of the Criminal Appeal No. 224/2023 without prior leave of the learned Special Judge,
Bongaigaon, Assam;
2. The applicant/appellant shall not directly or indirectly make any inducement,
threat or promise to the victim girl in any manner during the pendency of Criminal Appeal No. 224/2023;
